{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/sTkvGuv5TEdf80FwZmE9UQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:58.177011+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/sTkvGuv5TEdf80FwZmE9UQ","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/eYicSfymcBnQWQazuhTmribO4MbjMsoTr0tuNkuwuia2Zsuu7f9PiaNvuUDA3JYD2qIibnRMuzl4FYh1KvnJ7wZ7oZQtIzvVwxErUzOfXyt5rwwA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/btLkCxjz5dJKmEo0icEYkYXkfKibuYBQYPGAPN7ByPImO8U0jmZL3NkRs9XnLdstxwXIibr7KKbKLqfuVmvzeY8o1j3xJzSbPjEQU7NFxOicFy4/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><span>澳門大學應用物理及材料工程研究院 (IAPME) 成立於2014年，並于2016年成爲學院級研究所，於2019年正式更名為研究院。研究院面積為6000多平方米，具備材料測試表徵和製備中心（SEM，TEM，Raman， FIB， XRD， PPMS， 飛秒鐳射，XPS， 超低溫系統， PLD， 超淨閒，器件製備等），及高性能計算平臺。研究院提供均衡的基礎研究和應用研究，是彌合純科學與工程之間差距的獨特實體。這個跨學科研究院將結合澳門大學的多元化研究優勢和專業知識，為未來的技術挑戰提供解決方案。目前，研究院的核心研究領域包括：</span></p><p><span>    （1）光電•電光高效率轉換材料</span></p><p><span>    （2）能源存儲材料及催化能源材料</span></p><p><span>    （3）節能、環境及新功能材料</span></p><p><span>    （4）量子資訊及微納技術應用</span></p><p><span>    （5）量子生物醫學技術等</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/eYicSfymcBnTMvrA3e432m7h1q3Mt4iaicoSz1gtLes2XnO9MMWsp6BBmeFqvicNBadthRl9Rqz2icw3oN2B3YIicIdbnPD3Gib0INE9hmCAZhjajM/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/MVPvEL7Qg0GyyxhfUsSmLglbVIv6s4n5U9qCtKSWqQCAPBv0VzqZB7TE584TWdGJTKRfGH6mPMkwo2qBBOm4lQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/eYicSfymcBnSe1K4aRUwgiaiabZibbxPwx0nNYuEmDuCkV1fqUH12I7xuAOGEuSw3bnTlZbzcYPEibdr4iaDyvaJUiaoDdj0GEUKxQkdfkx60rqrtQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/MVPvEL7Qg0GyyxhfUsSmLglbVIv6s4n5U9qCtKSWqQCAPBv0VzqZB7TE584TWdGJTKRfGH6mPMkwo2qBBOm4lQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/MVPvEL7Qg0GyyxhfUsSmLglbVIv6s4n5R4WG3XOWLwb3tYeWdB9hpEtF85DzvZD5aWp2qBungDF2Vy904UIPibg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>Summer Camp</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/mIShLLnJibQIsWuSpcHWM4ib5rYtickRSyhO3zu3S6RLjMYBe7tibkonibGs2QLGe5U3NNVic05luicicn4XSWCbh3brhxztWXEqePjaLQnEMpZcdVc/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/mIShLLnJibQIsWuSpcHWM4ib5rYtickRSyhO3zu3S6RLjMYBe7tibkonibGs2QLGe5U3NNVic05luicicn4XSWCbh3brhxztWXEqePjaLQnEMpZcdVc/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>活動日期：2026年7月13日至16日</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>報名截止日期：</span><span><span>2026年4月30日</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>報名要求：</span></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>有意攻讀澳門大學應用物理及材料工程研究院碩士或博士課程的學生，就讀於物理、化學、材料科學與工程、能源、環境工程等專業的優秀學生，符合以下任一項要求將有機會優先錄取：</span></p><ul><ul><li><p><span>學業成績平均75分以上、或班級排名前20%、或者GPA ≥ 3；</span><span><span><br/></span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>應屆本科三、四年級或即將畢業的碩士生。</span></span></p></li></ul></ul></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>活動行程：</span></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/eYicSfymcBnTOGRFFiaSOztKOybxOA11lo9ibWBaAoB8L5VLJIhtgaWMDHiaADAErh7UjRyNoERn25MuDkdeJs0FfKA98FeZ1mokrEb0ztaaiaic4/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>注意事項：</span></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>澳門大學應用物理及材料工程研究院將負責安排以下費用：</span></p><ol><ol><li><p><span>夏令營期間入住澳門學之住宿費</span><span><span><br/></span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>開營晚宴</span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>實驗室教學所需的耗材</span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>在校活動時的午膳</span></span></p></li></ol></ol><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span>參與活動的同學需負責準備以下費用：</span></p><ol><ol><li><p><span>進出澳門的有效旅遊證件及簽證，包括所需費用</span><span><span><br/></span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>往返澳門的交通安排及其相關費用</span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>自由活動時的所有費用</span></span><span><span><br/></span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>外遊保險</span></span></p></li></ol></ol></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>查詢：</span></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>如有任何疑問，請聯絡應用物理及材料工程研究院</span></p><p><span>電話：+853 88224142 </span></p><p><span>電郵：iapme.summercamp@um.edu.mo</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span>*澳門大學應用物理及材料工程研究院保留最終決定權及解釋權</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/eYicSfymcBnQlYvzwiaHaMxKyBFFD0PZGVEvT0V2o42m0hfHuAppSZ9zYPGOTUT2IwEu79y8tGHOlibDj5ERxh5mic97BibZia2f5XJRDIZCp6ano/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/MVPvEL7Qg0FhvN6GSJUZ8G2RzcNUt1aApcxefiahWtDbDRuZuGkic8HtH2ozaXIHhdvNibBd4hc2ztpmNGe0xPJQg/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>澳門大學應用物理及材料工程研究院</span></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>微信公眾號｜澳大IAPME</span></span></strong><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>https://iapme.um.edu.mo/</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"3bee0ebee5e85443a7aee5d0735474fd3eb65e2bfa2df0f244e2d996145ba185","textLe